\f0 We've now got two quite different operations built from your same cross-product table.\
One looks at relationships between vectors:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 \\[ \\boxed\{I\\times_7O\} \\]\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 The other looks at relationships between changes in a state:\
